Scouter Go

This project implements compatibility with Scouter.
Protocol behavior is derived from the Scouter source project:
https://github.com/scouter-project/scouter
Copyright 2015 the original Scouter author or authors.
Scouter is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

The following files are copied or adapted from the Scouter source and keep
its license:
  cmd/scouter-go/counters.xml
  internal/account/defaults/account.xml
  internal/account/defaults/account_group.xml
  internal/server/telegraf-sample.xml
  internal/service/testdata/management/account/ (the *.default.xml files)

The Java and Scala sources under tools/java-*/seams/ are test seams that
reproduce or mirror parts of the Scouter classes they replace, and keep its
license.

internal/storage/visitor_hll.go follows the HyperLogLog implementation of
stream-lib (Copyright Clearspring Technologies, Apache License, Version 2.0)
as used by Scouter.

internal/geoip reads the legacy GeoIP database format. It is an independent
implementation written from the format and from observed behavior of the
geoip-api library; no code of that library is included. The country code
table lists public ISO 3166 codes in the order the format defines.

internal/pulse/kafka includes independent implementations of the LZ4 frame
format and the xxHash32 checksum, written from their public specifications.

Source revisions and design-only references are recorded in
docs/compatibility/baseline.json and docs/reference-evaluation.md.
The reference Go server has not been imported wholesale into this project.
